{"title": "Soap Bar", "pageid": 24677, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soap_Bar", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Soap_Bar_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Soap_Bar_Faded.png/300px-Soap_Bar_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/4/4b/Soap_Bar_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Soap Bar image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Soap_Bar_Faded.png/300px-Soap_Bar_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Soap_Bar_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Soap Bar</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item. Primarily of use for bartering or sale to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">Traders</a>. Using it will clean off dirt, blood, face-paint. It also will remove <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stench_(Condition)\" title=\"Stench (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stench\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stench_(Condition)\" title=\"Stench (Condition)\">Stench</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A sizeable bar of soap with a relaxing chamomile fragrance.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-0e578d40f72112fbEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-33fc8eb7ee5127cdEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_Bathroom_Soap_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Bathroom_Soap_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Bathroom_Soap_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d32a68ff-3b6a-4d83-b0c4-0a2c44b93ea9</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d32a68ff-3b6a-4d83-b0c4-0a2c44b93ea9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d32a68ff-3b6a-4d83-b0c4-0a2c44b93ea9\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p>Using this will clean off dirt, blood, and face-paint. It also will remove <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stench_(Condition)\" title=\"Stench (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stench\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Smelly_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stench_(Condition)\" title=\"Stench (Condition)\">Stench</a>. This does not cost an action. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster%27s_Library\" title=\"Elminster's Library\">Elminster's Library</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;7&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;110</span></li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-104&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;403</span></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Waukeen%27s_Rest\" title=\"Waukeen's Rest\">Waukeen's Rest</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-81&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;603</span></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715031419\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1744/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25107/4194304 bytes\nTempla